	(text "GPIO / INTERFACE MAP (nRF9161 PS Table 55). All 32 GPIOs on J12/J13.\nP0.00-P0.03 LED1-4 (open-drain OK; still on headers)\nP0.04 UART_CTS  P0.05 UART_RTS  P0.06 UART_TX  P0.07 UART_RX  (J9 default)\nP0.08 USER button (SW3, 10k to VDD_GPIO)\nP0.09 I2S_SDIN  P0.10 I2S_SCK  P0.11 I2S_LRCK  P0.12 I2S_SDOUT  (J16)\nP0.13-P0.20 AIN0-AIN7 (J18)  P0.17/P0.18 also PDM CLK/DIN (J17)\nP0.21 SPI_SCK / TRACECLK  P0.22 SPI_MOSI / SWO  P0.23 SPI_MISO  P0.24 SPI_CS  (J10)\nP0.25 TRACE D3  P0.26-P0.29 expansion  P0.30 SDA  P0.31 SCL  (J11)\nDefault UART/SPI/I2C/I2S/PDM are header labels only — GPIOs are not dedicated in hardware except LEDs/USER."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cee4402c-a9d1-4d86-8d9f-6ee959acbaf2")
	)
	(text "GPIO / INTERFACE MAP (nRF9161 PS Table 55)\nP0.00 pin95  J12 LED1 D4\nP0.01 pin96  J12 LED2 D5\nP0.02 pin97  J12 LED3 D6\nP0.03 pin99  J12 LED4 D7\nP0.04 pin100 UART CTS J9\nP0.05 pin2   UART RTS J9\nP0.06 pin3   UART TX J9\nP0.07 pin4   UART RX J9\nP0.08 pin15  J12 USER SW3\nP0.09 pin16  I2S SDIN J16\nP0.10 pin18  I2S SCK J16\nP0.11 pin19  I2S LRCK J16\nP0.12 pin20  I2S SDOUT J16\nP0.13 pin23  AIN0 J18\nP0.14 pin24  AIN1 J18\nP0.15 pin25  AIN2 J18\nP0.16 pin26  AIN3 J18/J13\nP0.17 pin28  AIN4/PDM CLK J17\nP0.18 pin29  AIN5/PDM DIN J17\nP0.19 pin30  AIN6 J18\nP0.20 pin35  AIN7 J18\nP0.21 pin37  SPI SCK / TRACECLK J10\nP0.22 pin38  SPI MOSI / SWO J8/J10\nP0.23 pin39  SPI MISO J10\nP0.24 pin40  SPI CS J10\nP0.25 pin42  J13 TRACEDATA3\nP0.26 pin83  J13\nP0.27 pin84  J13\nP0.28 pin86  J13\nP0.29 pin87  J13\nP0.30 pin88  I2C SDA J11\nP0.31 pin89  I2C SCL J11\nHeaders are labels only except LEDs and USER.\nDo not wire SIM_DET (pin 45); it must float."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e8ff73ea-c6d0-489f-9f85-fde146d90bb5")
	)
